{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23529","headline":"洛城东花下作 · 白居易","name":"洛城东花下作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"记得旧诗章，花多数洛阳及逢枝似雪，已是鬓成霜。\n向後光阴促，从前事意忙。\n无因重年少，何计驻时芳。\n欲送愁离面，须倾酒入肠。\n白头无藉在，醉倒亦何妨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}